    <string name="protected_space_title">Protected space</string>
    <string name="protected_space_description">A second space with its own PIN, opened from the same lock screen. This phone otherwise works as usual and doesn\'t show the protected space. Set a duress PIN and password too: entering either one at any prompt wipes the phone. A reboot PIN restarts the phone so that everything is locked again. All PINs need 6 digits or more and must differ from each other.</string>
